  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open settings menu in full view\n\n3. Go to graphics settings\n\n4. Look for bloom slider, it is no longer there\n\nDue to the fact that this bloom slider was removed in the latest update, my bloom settings are no longer set to off and as such I was greeted by a lot of bloom in worlds I went to. This is not good for users like me who have vision problems with bloom being enabled. Please fix this, I genuinely cannot play the game without my eyes acting up.",
